{"id":"n86775-1-8","stage":5,"title":"호칭 · 称呼","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86775-1-8-1","ko":"저와 동기여도 저보다 나이가 많으신데 제가 어떤 호칭으로 부르면 될까요?","zh":"虽然是同期，但您年纪比我大，我该怎么称呼您？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저와","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저와","audio":"/audio/901e7446753bc363401c.mp3"}},{"text":"동기여도","meaning":"同届，同期","explanation":"동기：同届，同期；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；여：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"동기","audio":"/audio/0e73b965399372d47878.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14796","senseId":"2","lemma":"동기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동기여도","audio":"/audio/0ab61af1411541bf0e5b.mp3"}},{"text":"저보다","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저보다","audio":"/audio/6a6ecfcf82c991a786c4.mp3"}},{"text":"나이가","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나이가","audio":"/audio/61d19a9f3b9c5119f3e9.mp3"}},{"text":"많으신데","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많으신데","audio":"/audio/9c3aa46d24f4b79948f7.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个。","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"호칭으로","meaning":"称呼","explanation":"호칭：称呼；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"호칭","audio":"/audio/cd640205d8a166cd9657.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86775","senseId":"1","lemma":"호칭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"호칭으로","audio":"/audio/997bbd01071664cafe37.mp3"}},{"text":"부르면","meaning":"叫做，称为","explanation":"부르다：叫做，称为；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"10","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부르면","audio":"/audio/d36fcc44d52f38752c42.mp3"}},{"text":"될까요?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"될까요","audio":"/audio/f7e990fb15ccc0daff50.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"0e73b965399372d4","term":"동기","zh":"同届，同期","audio":"/audio/0e73b965399372d47878.mp3","entryId":"14796","definition":"在相同时期进入学校、公司、训练所、社团等的人。","pronunciation":["동기"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"cd640205d8a166cd","term":"호칭","zh":"称呼","audio":"/audio/cd640205d8a166cd9657.mp3","entryId":"86775","definition":"取名字叫；或指该名字。","pronunciation":["호칭"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":"叫做，称为","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3","entryId":"57304","definition":"指着说是某某，或起名为某某。","pronunciation":["부르다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/256ccd1b34302cac37b6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86775-1-8-2","ko":"그냥 편하게 언니라고 부르세요.","zh":"随意点，叫我姐姐就行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그냥","meaning":"随便","explanation":"그냥：随便。","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"4","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}},{"text":"편하게","meaning":"舒服，舒畅","explanation":"편하다：舒服，舒畅；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"편하다","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71334","senseId":"1","lemma":"편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편하게","audio":"/audio/309170ec60471065c486.mp3"}},{"text":"언니라고","meaning":"姐姐、大姐（女性对年长女性的亲切称呼）","explanation":"언니：姐姐、大姐（女性对年长女性的亲切称呼）；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"3","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언니라고","audio":"/audio/eb8438425a74f51d06b6.mp3"}},{"text":"부르세요.","meaning":"叫做，称为","explanation":"부르다：叫做，称为；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"10","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부르세요","audio":"/audio/fb1266c5119e3065df02.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"随便","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"没有任何想法或别意地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"33bf1e37d2739b22","term":"편하다","zh":"舒服，舒畅","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3","entryId":"71334","definition":"身体或心情不难受，好。","pronunciation":["편하다"]},{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐、大姐（女性对年长女性的亲切称呼）","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":"叫做，称为","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3","entryId":"57304","definition":"指着说是某某，或起名为某某。","pronunciation":["부르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8dd4f911abfa69e72a1a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.542,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86775","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":172,"sequenceScore":3.3687,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["虽然是同期，但您年纪比我大，我该怎么称呼您？","随意点，叫我姐姐就行。","承奎这次比赛又把所有奖项都拿走了，对吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["虽然是同期，但您年纪比我大，我该怎么称呼您？","随意点，叫我姐姐就行。","承奎这次比赛又把所有奖项都拿走了，对吧？"],"answer":1}]}
